1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,700
Sometimes a dream stays with us
long after we wake.

2
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:10,700
Tell it, in writing or by voice.

3
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:15,700
See it in an image.

4
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:20,700
Choose the moment that stayed with you.

5
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:26,700
If you like, add an association
and up to three feelings.

6
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:30,500
And receive a personal reflection
and a short summary.

7
00:00:30,700 --> 00:00:33,700
Not a verdict, just questions
to think about.

8
00:00:34,300 --> 00:00:37,700
It all stays in your private journal.

9
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:40,000
DARE TO GO IN. Every dream has a story.
